-/// The ledger's own anchor operand (T9 LEAD pick): the ledger anchor is
-/// `C_L = DIGEST(SHK_PROGC, ANCHOR_D2)`, fixed at deploy. A placeholder of the ledger's program
-/// digest; binding it to a real `prog_d` key is T7/T10 work (a clean seam: only this constant).
-/// T7: the value for a real program is `sherlock_lfr::iface::anchor_d2(r_L, prog_d_ledger)`
-/// (tested in `t7_chain chain`: the honest anchor is accepted, the other program's anchor is
-/// refused by the `A_0 = C_P` tape check `lverify::gen_ops_check`). T10 replaces this constant.
-const ANCHOR_D2: u64 = 0x5e7_1ed9_e700;
-/// Lanes of the `acceptRun` call vector that the run publishes with `PUB` entries (template words
-/// of the ledger transcript, T10a: a non-empty `PUB` set on unmapped lanes).
-const PUB_LANES: [u64; 4] = [21, 22, 40, 41];
